---
title: "emergencyWithdraw (LegionFixedPriceSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: emergencyWithdraw(token, recipient, amount)
    q_check_auth --> q_check_params: caller is Legion operator
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_check_params --> q_check_balance: recipient != address(0) AND amount > 0
    q_check_params --> q_revert_params: invalid parameters
    q_check_balance --> q_transfer: token.balanceOf(address(this)) >= amount
    q_check_balance --> q_revert_balance: insufficient balance
    q_transfer --> q_emit: token.transfer(recipient, amount)
    q_emit --> [*]: emit EmergencyWithdraw(token, recipient, amount)
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert UnauthorizedAccess
    q_revert_params --> [*]: revert InvalidParameters
    q_revert_balance --> [*]: revert InsufficientBalance

    note right of q_transfer
        INV-001: emergencyWithdraw can extract any ERC20 token
        INV-002: only Legion operators can invoke (admin-only escape hatch)
    end note
